<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose six points to 1,367.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose six points to 1,367.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,367 today from 1,361 on July 9, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1441    13.086	  1437    13.050</p>
<p>   1a   1355 10264.000	  1342 10163.000</p>
